#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:4
msgid "BGP Neighbors"
msgstr "Voisins BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:6
msgid "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:11
msgid ""
"The BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) tab on a network router provides "
"management of BGP neighbor (peer) configurations. BGP is the primary "
"exterior gateway protocol used for routing between autonomous systems on "
"the Internet and within large enterprise networks. |morpheus| supports "
"configuring BGP neighbors on router types that expose this capability, "
"such as NSX Tier-0 Gateways."
msgstr "L'onglet BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) d'un routeur réseau permet de gérer les configurations de voisins BGP (pairs). BGP est le principal protocole de passerelle extérieure utilisé pour le routage entre systèmes autonomes sur Internet et au sein des grands réseaux d'entreprise. |morpheus| prend en charge la configuration de voisins BGP sur les types de routeurs qui exposent cette capacité, tels que les passerelles NSX Tier-0."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:52
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
msgid ""
"The BGP tab is available on router types that support BGP (``hasBgp`` "
"flag). Currently, NSX Tier-0 Gateways are the primary router type with "
"BGP neighbor support in |morpheus|."
msgstr "L'onglet BGP est disponible sur les types de routeurs prenant en charge BGP (indicateur ``hasBgp``). Actuellement, les passerelles NSX Tier-0 sont le principal type de routeur avec prise en charge des voisins BGP dans |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:16
msgid "Viewing BGP Neighbors"
msgstr "Consultation des voisins BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:59
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:69
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"
msgstr "Accédez à ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:29
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:60
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:70
msgid "Click on the target router to access the detail view"
msgstr "Cliquez sur le routeur cible pour accéder à la vue détaillée"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:30
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:61
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:71
msgid "Click the **BGP** tab"
msgstr "Cliquez sur l'onglet **BGP**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:21
msgid ""
"The list view displays BGP neighbors with their IP address, Remote AS, "
"and status information"
msgstr "La vue liste affiche les voisins BGP avec leur adresse IP, AS distant et informations de statut"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:23
msgid ""
"Use the search bar to filter neighbors by IP address, remote AS number, "
"or description."
msgstr "Utilisez la barre de recherche pour filtrer les voisins par adresse IP, numéro d'AS distant ou description."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:26
msgid "Adding a BGP Neighbor"
msgstr "Ajout d'un voisin BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:31
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Cliquez sur :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:32
msgid "Complete the configuration fields:"
msgstr "Remplissez les champs de configuration :"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Adresse IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:34
msgid "The IP address of the BGP neighbor"
msgstr "L'adresse IP du voisin BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Remote AS"
msgstr "AS distant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:35
msgid "The Autonomous System number of the remote peer"
msgstr "Le numéro de système autonome du pair distant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Forwarding Address"
msgstr "Adresse de transfert"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:36
msgid "(optional) The forwarding address for the neighbor"
msgstr "(optionnel) L'adresse de transfert du voisin"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Protocol Address"
msgstr "Adresse de protocole"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:37
msgid "(optional) The protocol address for the neighbor"
msgstr "(optionnel) L'adresse de protocole du voisin"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Poids"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:38
msgid "(optional) The weight value for route preference"
msgstr "(optionnel) La valeur de poids pour la préférence de route"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Keep Alive"
msgstr "Keep Alive"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:39
msgid ""
"(optional) The keepalive interval in seconds (default varies by "
"integration)"
msgstr "(optionnel) L'intervalle keepalive en secondes (la valeur par défaut varie selon l'intégration)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Hold Down"
msgstr "Hold Down"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:40
msgid "(optional) The hold-down timer in seconds (typically 3x keepalive)"
msgstr "(optionnel) Le minuteur hold-down en secondes (généralement 3x le keepalive)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Mot de passe"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:41
msgid "(optional) The MD5 authentication password for the BGP session"
msgstr "(optionnel) Le mot de passe d'authentification MD5 pour la session BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Route Filtering Type"
msgstr "Type de filtrage de route"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:42
msgid "(optional) The type of route filtering applied (e.g., IP Prefix List)"
msgstr "(optionnel) Le type de filtrage de route appliqué (par ex., liste de préfixes IP)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Route Filtering In"
msgstr "Filtrage de route entrant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:43
msgid "(optional) Inbound route filter reference"
msgstr "(optionnel) Référence du filtre de route entrant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Route Filtering Out"
msgstr "Filtrage de route sortant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:44
msgid "(optional) Outbound route filter reference"
msgstr "(optionnel) Référence du filtre de route sortant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "BFD Enabled"
msgstr "BFD activé"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:45
msgid ""
"(optional) Enable Bidirectional Forwarding Detection for faster failure "
"detection"
msgstr "(optionnel) Activer la détection de transfert bidirectionnelle pour une détection plus rapide des pannes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "BFD Interval"
msgstr "Intervalle BFD"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:46
msgid "(optional) BFD packet transmission interval in milliseconds"
msgstr "(optionnel) Intervalle de transmission des paquets BFD en millisecondes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "BFD Multiple"
msgstr "Multiple BFD"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:47
msgid "(optional) BFD detection multiplier"
msgstr "(optionnel) Multiplicateur de détection BFD"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Allow AS In"
msgstr "Autoriser AS entrant"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:48
msgid "(optional) Allow the local AS number in received AS paths"
msgstr "(optionnel) Autoriser le numéro d'AS local dans les chemins AS reçus"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Restart Mode"
msgstr "Mode de redémarrage"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:49
msgid "(optional) Graceful restart mode configuration"
msgstr "(optionnel) Configuration du mode de redémarrage en douceur"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Hop Limit"
msgstr "Limite de sauts"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:50
msgid "(optional) Maximum number of hops to the BGP peer (for eBGP multihop)"
msgstr "(optionnel) Nombre maximal de sauts vers le pair BGP (pour eBGP multihop)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:52
msgid ""
"Additional fields may appear based on the router type and its configured "
"option types."
msgstr "Des champs supplémentaires peuvent apparaître en fonction du type de routeur et de ses types d'options configurés."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:54
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:64
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Cliquez sur :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:57
msgid "Editing a BGP Neighbor"
msgstr "Modification d'un voisin BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:62
msgid "Click the pencil (edit) icon for the target BGP neighbor"
msgstr "Cliquez sur l'icône crayon (modifier) du voisin BGP cible"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:63
msgid "Modify the desired fields"
msgstr "Modifiez les champs souhaités"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:67
msgid "Deleting a BGP Neighbor"
msgstr "Suppression d'un voisin BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:72
msgid "Click the delete icon for the target BGP neighbor"
msgstr "Cliquez sur l'icône de suppression du voisin BGP cible"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:73
msgid "Confirm the deletion when prompted"
msgstr "Confirmez la suppression lorsque vous y êtes invité"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:75
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Avertissement"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:75
msgid ""
"Removing a BGP neighbor will terminate the BGP session with that peer. "
"This will cause any routes learned from that neighbor to be withdrawn, "
"potentially affecting network connectivity."
msgstr "La suppression d'un voisin BGP mettra fin à la session BGP avec ce pair. Toutes les routes apprises de ce voisin seront retirées, ce qui peut affecter la connectivité réseau."

